<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/>
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light"/>
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light"/>
<title>[{!Account.WCF_Organizational_Name__c}] Update on your Wadhwani Grants application</title>

<!--[if mso]>
<xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml>
<style>body,table,td,a,p,h1{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif !important;}</style>
<![endif]-->

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@500;600;700&family=Open+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>

<style>
html,body{margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;width:100% !important;}
body{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;}
table{border-collapse:collapse !important;mso-table-lspace:0pt !important;mso-table-rspace:0pt !important;}
img{-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;}
a{color:#BF2026;}
div[style*="margin: 16px 0"]{margin:0 !important;}

@media only screen and (max-width:620px){
.frame{padding:0 !important;}
.container{width:100% !important;max-width:100% !important;border-radius:0 !important;border-left:0 !important;border-right:0 !important;}
.pad{padding-left:22px !important;padding-right:22px !important;}
.hdr{padding:20px 22px !important;}
.logo-hdr{width:100px !important;}
.logo-ftr{width:114px !important;}
.bh{font-size:19px !important;line-height:1.25 !important;}
}
</style>

</head>

<body width="100%" bgcolor="#F4F4F5" style="margin:0;padding:0 !important;background-color:#F4F4F5;">
<center role="article" aria-roledescription="email" lang="en" style="width:100%;background-color:#F4F4F5;">

<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;color:#F4F4F5;">
An update on your application to Wadhwani Grants.
</div>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F4F4F5">
<tr>
<td class="frame" align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

<table role="presentation" class="container" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E6E6E6;border-radius:8px;">

<!-- HEADER -->
<tr>
<td class="hdr" bgcolor="#BF2026" style="padding:24px 32px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">

<!-- Header: text left, logo right (same row) -->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle">

<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:'Barlow','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F9C9A8;">
Decision
</p>

<h1 class="bh" style="margin:0;font-family:'Barlow','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">
An update on your application
</h1>

</td>
<td align="right" valign="middle" width="136" style="padding-left:16px;">

<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wfdev.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020UmX&oid=00DF6000000APXN&lastMod=1782557340000"
alt="Wadhwani Foundation"
width="136"
class="logo-hdr"
style="display:block;width:136px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;">

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- ORANGE DIVIDER -->
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#F2672A" height="4" style="height:4px;background:#F2672A;">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<!-- BODY -->
<tr>
<td class="pad" style="padding:28px 32px 10px;">

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Hello {!Account.FirstName},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Thank you for the time and care <strong>{!Account.WCF_Organizational_Name__c}</strong> put into the application, and for sharing your work with us.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
After careful consideration, we have decided not to move forward with the application at this time. This reflects our current priorities and the volume of strong applications we receive. It is not a reflection of the importance or impact of your work, which we deeply value.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
We would welcome the opportunity to stay in touch, and you are warmly invited to apply again in the future as our focus areas evolve. If you would like to connect with us, you are welcome to reach out at grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org.
</p>

<p style="margin:18px 0 8px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#414042;">
With appreciation and best wishes,<br/>
{!Account.PL__c}<br/>
Wadhwani Grants
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- DIVIDER -->
<tr>
<td class="pad" style="padding:0 32px;">
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E6E6E6;margin:6px 0 0;"/>
</td>
</tr>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<tr>
<td class="pad" style="padding:22px 32px 26px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">

<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wfdev.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020VVh&oid=00DF6000000APXN&lastMod=1782560396000"
width="132"
alt="Wadhwani Grants"
class="logo-ftr"
style="display:block;width:132px;height:auto;margin:0 0 12px;"/>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
Wadhwani Grants — the grant-making arm of the Wadhwani Foundation.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
Questions? Just reply to this email — it reaches the Wadhwani Grants team at
<a href="mailto:grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org" style="color:#6D6E71;text-decoration:underline;">grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org</a>.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'Open Sans','Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
&copy; {!YEAR(TODAY())} Wadhwani Charitable Foundation. All rights reserved.
</p>

</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

</center>
</body>
</html>